# Dragonhawk, Fate's Tempest: X is "the number of creatures you control with power 4 or greater". Bot1 controls Hired Blade
# (power 3, one under the boundary) and Bot2 controls Kokusho (power 5, but not Bot1's), so on turn 3 only Dragonhawk counts:
# X = 1, and one Lightning Bolt is exiled (the second stays on top of the library). Bot1 does not play it, so at the
# beginning of its end step Dragonhawk deals 2 damage to Bot2 (20 to 18). The permission ended with that end step: on
# turn 5 the Bolt can no longer be cast from exile (and the unplayed card is not owed again).

